=== Transfer ===
Due to it being {{Rift Transferable}}, a '''Hemobomb''' can be transferred to the [[Rift]] through the Ender Chest behind the [[Dark Auction]]. Once in the [[Rift]], a '''Hemobomb''' can be used as described above.

